  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 337.9,
   "w": 296.3,
   "size": 11.6,
   "flags": 0,
   "text": "4 “ As for me , look, my covenant is with you,"
  },
  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 362.3,
   "w": 346.3,
   "size": 13.6,
   "flags": 0,
   "text": "and you will become a father of a multitude of nations,"
  },
  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 380.6,
   "w": 322.8,
   "size": 11.6,
   "flags": 0,
