  },
  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 425.4,
   "w": 325.6,
   "size": 13.6,
   "flags": 0,
   "text": "because I will give you to be a multitude of nations,"
  },
  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 443.7,
   "w": 297.4,
   "size": 11.6,
   "flags": 0,
   "text": "6 and I will make you fruitful, very very much,"
  },
  {
   "x": 83.5,
   "y": 468.1,
   "w": 239.7,
   "size": 13.6,
   "flags": 0,
   "text": "and I will give you to become nations,"
